# Route: guide 49 of 51 of the simulator's completionist route for Tauren
# (1211 of 1222 eligible quests, 160.2 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 60 to
# 60, 23 quests, 4.1 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Silithus): Twilight Base Camp -> Hive'Ashi -> Twilight Base Camp ->
# Southwind Village -> Twilight Base Camp -> Hive'Regal -> Twilight Base Camp
# -> The Crystal Vale -> Twilight Base Camp -> Southwind Village -> Hive'Regal
# -> The Scarab Wall -> The Crystal Vale -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Wanted - Deathclasp, Terror of the
# Sands (8283; Deathclasp 59); Breaking the Code (8310; Hive'Regal Ambusher
# 59-60, Hive'Regal Burrower 59-60, Hive'Regal Spitfire 59-60, Hive'Regal
# Slavemaker 59-60, Hive'Regal Hive Lord 59-61).
#
# Profession quests here are not routed (they need the skill): 8307 Desert
# Recipe; 8313 Sharing the Knowledge; 8317 Kitchen Assistance.
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category).

